--      (home side when home_team_goal > away_team_goal OR away side when away_team_goal > home_team_goal).
--   2. loser_appearances : every non‑NULL player id that was on the losing side
--      (opposite goal comparisons).
--   3. win_totals  & loss_totals: aggregate counts per player.
--   4. max_win     & max_loss   : keep only the single highest count in each set.
--   5. Join with Player to show readable names and output the two sought records.
